cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "Benchmark code for a data-driven evaluation of optimization techniques in cell culture media"
abstract: >-
  Code accompanying the Bioinformatics paper "A data-driven evaluation of
  optimization techniques in cell culture media". Implements two benchmark
  protocols (Hide-the-Label and Open Race) under two difficulty regimes
  (Regular and Hard) across six published cell-culture / cell-media datasets,
  with surrogate families spanning Gaussian processes, random forests, neural
  networks, and Bayesian neural networks, and a pool of Bayesian-optimization
  and design-of-experiments strategies.
